Debian GNU/Linux 12 (bookworm) 12 on X11 - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility)\n\n### Issue description\n\n[`PopupMenu::_get_mouse_over`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/594d64ec244b6b99321e2096987d4d69de4c8845/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L318) appears to have accumulated several mistakes. The results are not very noticeable in the default theme, but things like larger scroll bars can make the problems more obvious.\n\nHere in Right-to-Left layout, the highlight is not present with the cursor over Item 3:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8338f3d-39df-47bf-8692-9b55b42b3afd)\n\nHere in Left-to-Right layout, the highlight remains with the cursor over the scroll bar:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6007ef6-9b4a-486f-8585-2df1d2785342)\n\nThe scrollbar width is deducted from the target area twice in RTL layout:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/594d64ec244b6b99321e2096987d4d69de4c8845/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L323-L327\n\nThe left margin modifies the position, but neither it nor the right margin are deducted from the width.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/594d64ec244b6b99321e2096987d4d69de4c8845/scene/gui/popup_menu.cpp#L330-L333\n\n(PR of simplified version incoming)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMost prominent symptom is with Right-to-Left layout and wide scroll bars:\n1. Create an OptionButton.\n2. Set its Control Layout Direction to Right-to-Left.\n3. Add many items, to require a scroll bar.\n4. Set a theme with wide vertical scroll bars.\n5. Run.\n6. Click menu.\n7. Observe the mouseover highlight is removed from an item when cursor is towards the right hand edge.\n\n(Or run provided reproduction project. The RTL menu is the lower of the two.)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[popup-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19458226/popup-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104630/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}